1
00:00:09,009 --> 00:00:11,010
Kugisaki, don't touch his blood.

2
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:12,929
I know--

3
00:00:15,515 --> 00:00:17,434
Run.

4
00:00:17,517 --> 00:00:19,352
Run with your back against me.

5
00:00:24,399 --> 00:00:26,818
Kugisaki, can you run faster?

6
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:27,902
I can't!

7
00:00:35,285 --> 00:00:36,536
I'll have your back.

8
00:00:37,328 --> 00:00:38,496
Thanks a lot.

9
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:41,791
What?

10
00:00:48,923 --> 00:00:52,343
What terrifying speed.
He was carrying a person, too.

11
00:00:56,431 --> 00:00:57,432
Damn it.

12
00:00:57,515 --> 00:00:59,059
They are going to escape.

13
00:00:59,142 --> 00:01:00,351
Forget it.

14
00:01:13,990 --> 00:01:16,034
Good. We're out of range, right?

15
00:01:16,951 --> 00:01:19,621
Well done. You have my praise.

16
00:01:19,704 --> 00:01:21,039
Whatever you say.

17
00:01:21,122 --> 00:01:23,041
Just kidding. Thank you.

18
00:01:23,124 --> 00:01:24,334
What?

19
00:01:30,465 --> 00:01:32,884
Did he take the shortest route
to ambush us?

20
00:01:32,967 --> 00:01:34,677
Itadori--

21
00:01:40,850 --> 00:01:41,976
Kugisaki!

22
00:01:42,477 --> 00:01:44,354
Don't worry.

23
00:01:44,437 --> 00:01:48,316
My brother's blood
has different properties than mine.

24
00:01:48,858 --> 00:01:54,781
Even my blood is not lethal
unless you get it all over your body.

25
00:01:54,864 --> 00:01:58,118
But it's going to hurt like hell.

26
00:01:58,618 --> 00:02:02,288
Our cursed technique
is only about to begin.

27
00:02:02,372 --> 00:02:04,040
Rot Technique…

28
00:02:04,958 --> 00:02:06,042
Decay.

29
00:02:12,298 --> 00:02:13,299
What…

30
00:03:44,849 --> 00:03:47,685
Membranes, wounds…

31
00:03:47,769 --> 00:03:51,064
If you're hit with our blood

32
00:03:51,147 --> 00:03:54,984
and one of us uses the cursed technique,

33
00:03:55,068 --> 00:03:58,529
that part of your body
will start to decompose.

34
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:02,200
That boy can last for 15 minutes at most.

35
00:04:02,283 --> 00:04:05,453
And you, perhaps ten minutes?

36
00:04:06,329 --> 00:04:09,249
You two will turn
into skeletons by morning.

37
00:04:09,832 --> 00:04:11,834
If this is a cursed technique,

38
00:04:11,918 --> 00:04:14,128
all I have to do is to undo it.

39
00:04:14,796 --> 00:04:16,130
So it's really poison?

40
00:04:16,214 --> 00:04:19,008
Poison is the end result.

41
00:04:19,092 --> 00:04:23,137
After all, our cursed technique
is only decomposition.

42
00:04:23,221 --> 00:04:25,723
My explanation
of the cursed technique is over.

43
00:04:25,807 --> 00:04:28,643
They will die faster than my prediction.

44
00:04:29,227 --> 00:04:31,729
Now what will you do?

45
00:04:32,730 --> 00:04:36,150
Brother, these people are nothing special.

46
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,987
In the Meiji Era,

47
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:42,448
there was a girl who bore a child
born of Cursed Spirit and human.

48
00:04:42,532 --> 00:04:44,951
Due to her unexplained pregnancy,

49
00:04:45,034 --> 00:04:47,745
she was ostracized by her family.

50
00:04:47,829 --> 00:04:49,956
She fled to a temple
run by a Jujutsu Sorcerer

51
00:04:50,039 --> 00:04:53,084
with her baby's corpse in her arms.

52
00:04:53,584 --> 00:04:57,672
But at that very moment,
she ran out of luck.

53
00:04:58,339 --> 00:04:59,841
Noritoshi Kamo.

54
00:04:59,924 --> 00:05:02,010
Knowledgeable about curses and Jujutsu,

55
00:05:02,093 --> 00:05:04,345
he is known
as the evilest sorcerer in history,

56
00:05:04,429 --> 00:05:06,222
and the disgrace of the Great Families.

57
00:05:06,306 --> 00:05:08,141
His immense curiosity

58
00:05:08,224 --> 00:05:11,477
made him obsessed with children
born of both Cursed Spirit and human.

59
00:05:12,061 --> 00:05:14,897
Nine pregnancies, nine abortions.

60
00:05:14,981 --> 00:05:19,444
How did the process go?
What happened to those women?

61
00:05:19,527 --> 00:05:21,654
All these records were erased.

62
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:25,700
Cursed Womb: Death Paintings 1 to 3.

63
00:05:25,783 --> 00:05:28,369
They are classified
as Special Grade Cursed Relics.

64
00:05:28,453 --> 00:05:32,165
Do their cursed energy originate
from their mother's grudge?

65
00:05:32,248 --> 00:05:33,207
Or…

66
00:05:33,291 --> 00:05:35,585
I don't remember anything about my mother.

67
00:05:36,461 --> 00:05:38,713
I also have born no hatred

68
00:05:38,796 --> 00:05:41,924
towards humans or Jujutsu Sorcerers.

69
00:05:42,425 --> 00:05:44,343
For 150 years,

70
00:05:45,178 --> 00:05:49,098
we relied on each other
to endure the seal placed on us.

71
00:05:49,182 --> 00:05:51,350
We'll side with the Cursed Spirits.

72
00:05:51,434 --> 00:05:53,436
Will it be okay?

73
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:55,855
He looks quite suspicious, Choso.

74
00:05:56,522 --> 00:05:58,816
The future painted by this Cursed Spirit

75
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:01,360
is more beneficial to us.

76
00:06:01,944 --> 00:06:03,905
That's all.

77
00:06:03,988 --> 00:06:06,324
Don't be grateful to them
for our incarnation.

78
00:06:06,407 --> 00:06:08,367
Brothers, listen carefully.

79
00:06:08,951 --> 00:06:10,870
Eso lives for Kechizu,

80
00:06:10,953 --> 00:06:13,372
Kechizu lives for me,

81
00:06:13,456 --> 00:06:15,875
and I live for Eso.

82
00:06:16,751 --> 00:06:20,379
The three of us are one entity.

83
00:06:20,463 --> 00:06:22,256
For my brothers,

84
00:06:22,340 --> 00:06:24,092
if this is their wish,

85
00:06:24,175 --> 00:06:27,136
then I'm willing to sacrifice my life.

86
00:06:27,220 --> 00:06:32,308
If this is too painful,
I can relieve your agony now.

87
00:06:32,809 --> 00:06:33,643
What?

88
00:06:34,227 --> 00:06:38,147
So you win once your cursed technique
lands on your mark.

89
00:06:38,231 --> 00:06:39,899
But what a shame.

90
00:06:40,483 --> 00:06:43,569
That's a bad match against me!

91
00:06:44,153 --> 00:06:45,404
Straw Doll Technique…

92
00:06:46,364 --> 00:06:47,406
Resonance!

93
00:06:51,369 --> 00:06:53,371
Let's have a game of endurance, shall we?

94
00:06:54,288 --> 00:06:55,873
You guys don't like pain, right?

95
00:06:56,791 --> 00:06:59,877
Then start crying
and undo the cursed technique!

96
00:07:01,963 --> 00:07:04,132
A curse used to counter techniques?

97
00:07:04,215 --> 00:07:06,092
A game of endurance?

98
00:07:06,175 --> 00:07:09,971
If we don't undo it,
this situation will continue?

99
00:07:11,264 --> 00:07:13,057
Straw Doll Technique: Resonance.

100
00:07:13,724 --> 00:07:18,771
It applies cursed energy to inflict damage

101
00:07:18,855 --> 00:07:21,732
to an opponent's targeted body part.

102
00:07:22,525 --> 00:07:25,027
The effective range is wide,
and the ability difference

103
00:07:25,111 --> 00:07:26,988
between the user and the target

104
00:07:27,071 --> 00:07:29,991
as well as the targeted body part
affects skill potency.

105
00:07:30,825 --> 00:07:34,829
In Straw Doll Technique,
the value of blood isn't high.

106
00:07:35,580 --> 00:07:36,622
However,

107
00:07:36,706 --> 00:07:39,584
Resonance activates
on a connection to the target.

108
00:07:40,376 --> 00:07:44,005
Now their blood and mine are tied together

109
00:07:44,088 --> 00:07:48,009
thanks to the Rot Technique
they used on me.

110
00:07:48,718 --> 00:07:51,888
Luckily, it's also effective
on the younger brother.

111
00:07:51,971 --> 00:07:53,973
I'm going to die in the end anyway.

112
00:07:54,724 --> 00:07:57,477
It's better to go on the offensive!

113
00:07:58,019 --> 00:08:00,563
Although it is quite powerful,

114
00:08:00,646 --> 00:08:04,150
it's still not enough to kill us
no matter how often she activates it.

115
00:08:04,233 --> 00:08:07,945
As long as we endure,
you will be the first one to die.

116
00:08:08,029 --> 00:08:09,489
When Decay is activated,

117
00:08:09,572 --> 00:08:14,160
the pain from the Rot Technique
will make it difficult for you to move--

118
00:08:18,581 --> 00:08:20,500
Why is he moving freely?

119
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,837
Resonance.

120
00:08:30,384 --> 00:08:34,722
Itadori is the vessel of Ryomen Sukuna,
the King of Deadly Poisons.

121
00:08:35,264 --> 00:08:38,142
Thus, he is immune to all kinds of poison.

122
00:08:38,726 --> 00:08:41,312
Poison is the end result.

123
00:08:41,395 --> 00:08:45,816
After all, our cursed technique
is only decomposition.

124
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:48,194
Although there is pain
caused by decomposition,

125
00:08:48,277 --> 00:08:50,821
the end result of poison
is ineffective against him.

126
00:08:50,905 --> 00:08:52,990
But mere pain…

127
00:08:57,203 --> 00:08:58,913
will not stop…

128
00:09:01,499 --> 00:09:03,000
Yuji Itadori!

129
00:09:07,838 --> 00:09:09,924
Kechizu!

130
00:09:10,883 --> 00:09:12,677
You're so noisy!

131
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:15,054
-Resonance!
-What?

132
00:09:17,974 --> 00:09:19,850
They switched positions?

133
00:09:19,934 --> 00:09:21,269
Is he making a dying woman

134
00:09:21,352 --> 00:09:23,938
attack my younger brother,
who's dying faster?

135
00:09:24,021 --> 00:09:26,315
Do you think you can stop
my actions at any time?

136
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:29,986
Hey, you woman!

137
00:09:30,069 --> 00:09:32,280
Should I undo my cursed technique?

138
00:09:32,363 --> 00:09:34,699
I can't save my brother if this continues.

139
00:09:34,782 --> 00:09:37,785
If I activate Decay,
I can't use Wing King.

140
00:09:37,868 --> 00:09:42,707
But does that woman have enough energy
to kill my brother now?

141
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,751
Even if she gets in the way,

142
00:09:45,835 --> 00:09:50,548
I won't get killed by this guy
before she dies.

143
00:09:51,132 --> 00:09:54,510
I will never undo the cursed technique!

144
00:09:55,261 --> 00:09:57,346
Eso…

145
00:09:58,222 --> 00:10:01,350
The three of us are one entity.

146
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:15,239
I undid
the cursed technique instinctively.

147
00:10:19,327 --> 00:10:20,369
Wing King!

148
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:04,997
What was that black light just now?

149
00:11:06,457 --> 00:11:07,792
I'm sure that

150
00:11:07,875 --> 00:11:11,379
I used my arm to block his fist
that was covered in cursed energy.

151
00:11:12,296 --> 00:11:15,716
But before I knew it,
my entire arm was cut off.

152
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,968
Kechizu…

153
00:11:18,052 --> 00:11:20,471
Don't die, Kechizu.

154
00:11:22,264 --> 00:11:24,892
Eso!

155
00:11:28,312 --> 00:11:32,233
I think I haven't shown you this trick.

156
00:11:37,113 --> 00:11:38,322
Hairpin.

157
00:11:43,452 --> 00:11:45,162
Don't worry.

158
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:49,083
I'll send your brother
to accompany you right away.

159
00:11:50,876 --> 00:11:52,169
Kechizu…

160
00:11:52,753 --> 00:11:57,007
The three of us are one entity.

161
00:11:57,883 --> 00:12:00,052
I'm sorry, Choso.

162
00:12:00,136 --> 00:12:02,304
I was right by his side, and yet…

163
00:12:03,889 --> 00:12:05,766
Why didn't he disappear?

164
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:07,309
Is he still alive?

165
00:12:07,393 --> 00:12:08,477
No!

166
00:12:08,561 --> 00:12:11,480
He's not a Cursed Spirit!
He has a physical body.

167
00:12:15,860 --> 00:12:17,278
It's dangerous!

168
00:12:17,361 --> 00:12:18,946
For god's sake.

169
00:12:19,572 --> 00:12:20,823
What?

170
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:23,367
Mr. Sawamura!

171
00:12:23,451 --> 00:12:25,619
-Drive faster.
-What?

172
00:12:25,703 --> 00:12:29,123
I'll kill you both
if you step on the brakes.

173
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:31,083
Do you understand?

174
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:42,219
Don't chase after me, Jujutsu Sorcerers.

175
00:12:42,845 --> 00:12:47,683
I'll kill them both when I recover.
Especially that woman.

176
00:12:47,766 --> 00:12:49,643
I'm sorry, Kechizu.

177
00:12:49,727 --> 00:12:51,187
I can't even grieve over you.

178
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:54,398
But I will take revenge.

179
00:12:55,608 --> 00:12:58,027
What is that woman doing?

180
00:12:58,110 --> 00:12:59,528
Kugisaki!

181
00:13:02,198 --> 00:13:04,992
Don't rush me!

182
00:13:05,576 --> 00:13:07,161
Straw Doll Technique…

183
00:13:08,162 --> 00:13:10,289
Resonance!

184
00:13:20,883 --> 00:13:22,510
After using Black Flash,

185
00:13:22,593 --> 00:13:27,515
a sorcerer will enter the zone,
similar to what athletes experience.

186
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:32,728
Darn it!

187
00:13:32,811 --> 00:13:36,023
That wasn't just a counter technique?

188
00:13:39,860 --> 00:13:40,819
I'm sorry.

189
00:14:01,173 --> 00:14:02,508
It hurts.

190
00:14:07,596 --> 00:14:09,014
Geto, stock.

191
00:14:09,598 --> 00:14:11,850
-What's wrong, Choso?
-Hurry up.

192
00:14:13,310 --> 00:14:15,813
Hey! Don't smash the chess piece!

193
00:14:15,896 --> 00:14:17,982
My brothers died.

194
00:14:18,065 --> 00:14:20,067
So you can sense this kind of thing?

195
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,986
What happened?

196
00:14:22,069 --> 00:14:24,530
I can understand
if it's a fully fleshed Cursed Spirit,

197
00:14:24,613 --> 00:14:28,158
but I don't think they could be defeated
by a curse that swallowed one finger.

198
00:14:28,242 --> 00:14:30,703
-Wait a minute.
-I can't find one.

199
00:14:30,786 --> 00:14:32,872
Why did you break it, anyway?

200
00:14:33,914 --> 00:14:35,791
I got the report.

201
00:14:35,875 --> 00:14:38,335
Eso and Kechizu were killed by

202
00:14:38,419 --> 00:14:40,254
Jujutsu High first-years,

203
00:14:40,337 --> 00:14:43,507
Yuji Itadori and his classmate.

204
00:14:49,346 --> 00:14:51,265
SUGINAMI 385
64-355

205
00:14:53,976 --> 00:14:57,187
The number you dialed
cannot be reached at the moment…

206
00:14:57,271 --> 00:14:59,064
They still won't pick up!

207
00:14:59,148 --> 00:15:01,442
Where did those brats go?

208
00:15:04,528 --> 00:15:06,447
Kugisaki, are you okay?

209
00:15:06,530 --> 00:15:08,741
Yes, I guess so.

210
00:15:08,824 --> 00:15:10,784
But it may leave scars.

211
00:15:11,285 --> 00:15:14,204
Is that old man okay? He just drove away.

212
00:15:14,288 --> 00:15:17,249
As for the poison…

213
00:15:17,333 --> 00:15:19,543
When we get back,
will Ms. Shoko still be awake?

214
00:15:19,627 --> 00:15:21,003
Will she even be sober?

215
00:15:21,921 --> 00:15:24,465
Why are you fidgeting? It's gross.

216
00:15:25,215 --> 00:15:27,384
I wonder if this is your first time

217
00:15:28,010 --> 00:15:30,304
killing someone
instead of exorcising them.

218
00:15:30,804 --> 00:15:31,972
What about you?

219
00:15:32,556 --> 00:15:33,807
I did it once.

220
00:15:33,891 --> 00:15:38,270
No, that would be misleading.
I killed three people.

221
00:15:38,354 --> 00:15:41,440
You are doing much worse than me.

222
00:15:42,775 --> 00:15:45,027
Frankly speaking, I don't feel anything.

223
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:47,488
This is normal
for a Jujutsu Sorcerer, right?

224
00:15:48,489 --> 00:15:50,491
Not to quote Fushiguro,

225
00:15:50,574 --> 00:15:53,744
but there are only
so many people we can save.

226
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:57,915
My opinion is, well…

227
00:15:57,998 --> 00:16:02,670
People who are not involved in my life
should not affect how I do things.

228
00:16:03,587 --> 00:16:04,672
Am I cold?

229
00:16:05,464 --> 00:16:10,302
But there are also people like you
doing whatever they want.

230
00:16:11,887 --> 00:16:13,806
I'm not trying to comfort you,

231
00:16:13,889 --> 00:16:17,101
but we had no time to check if
they were Cursed Spirits or Curse Users.

232
00:16:17,601 --> 00:16:19,061
Even if the opponent is a human,

233
00:16:19,144 --> 00:16:22,314
we're not capable of trapping
opponents of that level for long.

234
00:16:22,398 --> 00:16:23,691
You know it, don't you?

235
00:16:24,274 --> 00:16:29,029
But he cried when his brother
died in front of him.

236
00:16:30,447 --> 00:16:31,657
I see.

237
00:16:32,366 --> 00:16:36,453
I'm so glad that you and I survived.

238
00:16:36,537 --> 00:16:37,788
I feel so relieved.

239
00:16:38,747 --> 00:16:44,169
Even so, someone cried over a life I took.

240
00:16:45,379 --> 00:16:46,380
That's all.

241
00:16:47,798 --> 00:16:49,216
I see.

242
00:16:49,299 --> 00:16:52,720
Then that makes us accomplices.

243
00:16:55,389 --> 00:16:57,307
-Fushiguro?
-Fushiguro?

244
00:16:59,309 --> 00:17:01,020
Hey. You guys are back.

245
00:17:01,103 --> 00:17:02,688
I'm glad you're all right.

246
00:17:02,771 --> 00:17:04,690
That gave us a fright!

247
00:17:04,773 --> 00:17:06,442
We thought you were dead.

248
00:17:06,525 --> 00:17:07,818
We're so relieved!

249
00:17:08,402 --> 00:17:10,112
Please lower down your voices.

250
00:17:10,738 --> 00:17:11,822
My head hurts.

251
00:17:12,406 --> 00:17:14,700
Don't fall asleep with Sukuna's finger.

252
00:17:14,783 --> 00:17:15,826
It's too dangerous.

253
00:17:16,744 --> 00:17:18,704
How did you know about the finger?

254
00:17:18,787 --> 00:17:20,831
Do you have the energy to hear me out?

255
00:17:20,914 --> 00:17:24,293
No. Anyway, contact Ms. Nitta first.

256
00:17:24,376 --> 00:17:27,838
It must be sealed immediately
or Cursed Spirits will gather.

257
00:17:27,921 --> 00:17:29,923
Shall I eat them instead?

258
00:17:30,007 --> 00:17:31,925
They are not leftovers.

259
00:17:32,009 --> 00:17:34,636
We don't know
how many more fingers you can eat.

260
00:17:35,262 --> 00:17:36,346
Don't eat it.

261
00:17:36,430 --> 00:17:39,349
But take it
since you seem the least worn out.

262
00:17:40,017 --> 00:17:41,852
Let me remind you again. Don't eat it.

263
00:17:41,935 --> 00:17:45,355
He talks to me like I'm a dog.

264
00:17:49,401 --> 00:17:50,277
What?

265
00:17:54,239 --> 00:17:55,657
We told you not to eat it!

266
00:17:55,741 --> 00:17:56,992
Why is it my fault?

267
00:17:57,076 --> 00:17:58,786
This guy is too much.

268
00:17:58,869 --> 00:18:01,789
He's not helpful at all this time.

269
00:18:02,581 --> 00:18:04,875
The Sukuna in you
will tell us where they are

270
00:18:04,958 --> 00:18:07,336
since he wants to regain his powers.

271
00:18:08,003 --> 00:18:10,631
Don't tell me Mr. Gojo spouts nonsense?

272
00:18:10,714 --> 00:18:12,091
You just realized that?

273
00:18:12,174 --> 00:18:14,927
Hey, you guys!

274
00:18:15,010 --> 00:18:17,471
-What have you guys been up to?
-Ms. Nitta.

275
00:18:17,554 --> 00:18:19,473
-She's mad.
-You didn't pick up the phone.

276
00:18:19,556 --> 00:18:21,350
Explain it to me!

277
00:18:21,433 --> 00:18:24,812
-Can't you contact me?
-All right, let's go back.

278
00:18:24,895 --> 00:18:26,688
-Report, contact, discuss!
-I'm hungry.

279
00:18:26,772 --> 00:18:29,108
-Are you listening?
-Is there a Rippa Sushi nearby?

280
00:18:29,191 --> 00:18:31,318
-Answer me!
-Rippa Sushi in Shinkansen is good.

281
00:18:31,401 --> 00:18:32,361
You're so annoying.

282
00:18:33,779 --> 00:18:36,740
Man! It wasn't just
a Cursed Spirit with a finger.

283
00:18:36,824 --> 00:18:38,867
I was shocked
after investigating the remains!

284
00:18:38,951 --> 00:18:42,204
It turned out to be a vessel
of the Cursed Relic!

285
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:45,916
They defeated opponents equivalent
to a Special Grade.

286
00:18:45,999 --> 00:18:48,210
The first-years got it big.

287
00:18:48,293 --> 00:18:52,005
Is my coaching ability too good?

288
00:18:52,089 --> 00:18:55,467
I don't want to waste my holiday
talking to you.

289
00:18:55,551 --> 00:18:57,511
You want to ask about the party, right?

290
00:18:57,594 --> 00:18:59,221
So did you find it?

291
00:18:59,304 --> 00:19:00,639
Not at all.

292
00:19:00,722 --> 00:19:02,891
Everyone's too busy, including me.

293
00:19:02,975 --> 00:19:05,644
Well? Should I ask the students?

294
00:19:05,727 --> 00:19:09,231
I can't drink,
so nonalcoholic drinks are fine with me.

295
00:19:09,314 --> 00:19:12,025
Please continue to search for it.

296
00:19:13,277 --> 00:19:16,196
UTAHIME IORI

297
00:19:16,989 --> 00:19:20,576
After all, I don't know
if anyone's eavesdropping on her.

298
00:19:21,243 --> 00:19:22,619
I don't want to think about

299
00:19:22,703 --> 00:19:24,663
the possibility of a student
being the mole.

300
00:19:25,497 --> 00:19:27,166
It's so annoying.

301
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:31,170
Well then, I leave the rest to you, Mei.

302
00:19:36,216 --> 00:19:38,135
SATORU GOJO, 10 MILLION YEN

303
00:19:38,218 --> 00:19:40,137
CASH CARD ATM

304
00:19:40,929 --> 00:19:43,140
Don't tell Itadori
about the fingers resonating.

305
00:19:43,932 --> 00:19:45,601
Are you sure about that?

306
00:19:45,684 --> 00:19:46,852
I'm quite sure.

307
00:19:46,935 --> 00:19:48,145
The case is closed.

308
00:19:49,104 --> 00:19:53,525
Probably only Ms. Nitta and us
would notice this.

309
00:19:54,735 --> 00:19:58,447
Itadori only became
Sukuna's vessel by chance.

310
00:19:58,530 --> 00:20:02,201
The Yasohachi Bridge deaths
were bound to happen sooner or later.

311
00:20:03,243 --> 00:20:07,164
In the first place,
he swallowed the finger to save me.

312
00:20:07,998 --> 00:20:10,667
But he won't be happy
with that explanation.

313
00:20:11,376 --> 00:20:12,669
So don't tell him.

314
00:20:13,253 --> 00:20:14,588
I won't tell him.

315
00:20:14,671 --> 00:20:16,256
As a lady, I'm considerate.

316
00:20:17,132 --> 00:20:18,675
This is all your fault!

317
00:20:18,759 --> 00:20:20,928
Because you ate me,

318
00:20:21,011 --> 00:20:24,973
my scattered soul is awakened.

319
00:20:26,183 --> 00:20:28,685
Do you want to save
as many people as possible?

320
00:20:28,769 --> 00:20:29,895
Brat!

321
00:20:29,978 --> 00:20:32,898
Those people die because of you!

322
00:20:32,981 --> 00:20:35,442
Hey, don't tell Fushiguro about this.

323
00:20:36,151 --> 00:20:40,239
What if the person you saved
takes someone else's life later?

324
00:20:42,199 --> 00:20:43,242
Don't you dare.

325
00:20:55,921 --> 00:20:56,838
Leaf mustard.

326
00:20:57,547 --> 00:20:59,967
What's wrong? Your movements seem dull.

327
00:21:00,050 --> 00:21:01,093
Did you become weak?

328
00:21:01,176 --> 00:21:02,594
Shut up!

329
00:21:02,678 --> 00:21:05,097
My body's just weak after resting.

330
00:21:05,180 --> 00:21:09,184
Speaking of which, have you heard
about the first-year students?

331
00:21:09,268 --> 00:21:10,102
Yes.

332
00:21:10,185 --> 00:21:13,605
They exorcised
three Special Grade equivalents, right?

333
00:21:13,689 --> 00:21:14,856
Salmon.

334
00:21:16,817 --> 00:21:18,193
Well then…

335
00:21:18,277 --> 00:21:21,488
We can't lose to them.

336
00:21:21,571 --> 00:21:23,991
-Salted fish roe!
-Yes!

337
00:21:24,825 --> 00:21:26,034
What?

338
00:21:27,494 --> 00:21:29,830
Was that your full strength?

339
00:21:29,913 --> 00:21:31,999
If it wasn't, then it's not training!

340
00:21:32,082 --> 00:21:32,916
Kelp.

341
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:39,423
Special Grades are anomalies
among Jujutsu Sorcerers.

342
00:21:39,506 --> 00:21:43,802
I believe that Grade 1 Sorcerers
uphold the standards

343
00:21:43,885 --> 00:21:48,432
of the strongest sorcerers,
and are suitable leaders of our society.

344
00:21:48,515 --> 00:21:51,727
The level of danger,
confidentiality, and involvement…

345
00:21:51,810 --> 00:21:54,438
It is incomparable below Semi-Grade 1.

346
00:21:54,521 --> 00:21:57,441
And yet, what did you say just now?

347
00:21:57,524 --> 00:21:59,943
Maki Zenin, Panda…

348
00:22:00,027 --> 00:22:02,946
Megumi Fushiguro, Nobara Kugisaki,

349
00:22:03,030 --> 00:22:06,950
and my brother, Yuji Itadori,

350
00:22:07,034 --> 00:22:09,453
in the name of Aoi Todo…

351
00:22:09,536 --> 00:22:11,955
And in the name of Mei Mei…

352
00:22:12,039 --> 00:22:15,000
…we recommend them
to be promoted to Grade 1 Sorcerers.

353
00:22:22,716 --> 00:22:25,010
Don't you think you bought too much?

354
00:22:25,093 --> 00:22:26,762
Half of it belongs to you.

355
00:22:26,845 --> 00:22:29,181
My things are in this single bag!

356
00:22:29,264 --> 00:22:30,432
Oh, god!

357
00:22:32,559 --> 00:22:33,477
What?

358
00:22:33,560 --> 00:22:35,729
If you dare drop any of those bags,

359
00:22:36,271 --> 00:22:37,481
I will kill you.

360
00:22:37,564 --> 00:22:39,399
Yes, madam.

361
00:22:39,483 --> 00:22:40,484
What?

362
00:22:47,532 --> 00:22:50,535
I told you,
I would kill you if you dropped any of it!

363
00:22:50,619 --> 00:22:52,704
I'm sorry, I didn't mean it!

364
00:22:52,788 --> 00:22:55,957
-You should take at least one bag.
-How will you pay me if it breaks?

365
00:22:56,541 --> 00:22:57,459
I'm Fushiguro.

366
00:22:58,085 --> 00:23:00,170
Yes, okay.

367
00:23:00,921 --> 00:23:02,923
I got it. I'll hang up now.

368
00:23:04,341 --> 00:23:05,258
What's wrong?

369
00:23:05,342 --> 00:23:08,220
Mr. Gojo wants to see us.

370
00:23:08,303 --> 00:23:10,097
What? Why?

371
00:23:10,639 --> 00:23:11,848
It's a new mission.

372
00:23:11,932 --> 00:23:13,517
And a confidential one to boot.

373
00:23:13,600 --> 00:23:14,601
What?

374
00:23:14,684 --> 00:23:16,978
We just finished up one.

375
00:23:17,062 --> 00:23:18,021
Isn't this fine?

376
00:23:18,605 --> 00:23:21,316
Mr. Gojo just said that
it's a confidential mission.

377
00:23:21,399 --> 00:23:22,901
It must be interesting.

378
00:23:23,485 --> 00:23:24,903
He says that often.

379
00:23:24,986 --> 00:23:26,905
He always talks about it.

380
00:23:26,988 --> 00:23:29,783
Oh, well!

381
00:23:31,910 --> 00:23:32,953
Let's go.

382
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:40,794
TO BE CONTINUED
